OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the BBC Proms
OL,8,     Fincluding Elgar's 1st Symphony
OL,9,     Ffrom the BBC Scottish Symphony;
OL,10,     Fplus chamber highlights from the
OL,11,     Frecent Aldeburgh Festival.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,13,     F5/5. Donald Macleod dives into
OL,14,     FSmith's final years and explores
OL,15,     Fher last orchestral works, with
OL,16,     Fguests Ian Graham-Jones and Leanne
OL,17,     FLangley.
OL,18,G1700 In Tune
OL,19,     FKatie welcomes composer Dani
OL,20,     FHoward and mezzo-soprano Niamh
OL,21,     FO'Sullivan to In Tune.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
